<template>
  <section class="knowledge-page">
    <div class="kb-heading"><div><span class="kb-eyebrow">SURVEY KNOWLEDGE</span><h2>让答卷成为可追溯的知识</h2><p>整理问卷背景与回答原文，先检索资料，再由助手综合分析。</p></div><el-button :disabled="busy" @click="load">刷新列表</el-button></div>
    <el-alert v-if="error" :title="error" type="error" :closable="false" />
    <div class="kb-metrics"><article><span>可用问卷</span><strong>{{ rows.length }}</strong><small>当前账号已发布的问卷</small></article><article><span>已建立知识库</span><strong>{{ rows.filter(r=>r.indexed).length }}</strong><small>按问卷发布版本保存</small></article><article><span>已索引资料片段</span><strong>{{ rows.reduce((n,r)=>n+r.documentCount,0) }}</strong><small>题目背景与开放回答</small></article></div>
    <div class="kb-layout">
      <section class="kb-panel"><header><h3>问卷资料集</h3><span>{{ loading ? '加载中…' : '最近 100 份问卷' }}</span></header><p class="kb-note">同步最新发布版本；每次检索前校验答卷变化。草稿不作为调查结果入库。</p><el-empty v-if="!loading&&!rows.length" description="发布一份问卷后，即可建立知识库" />
        <article v-for="row in rows" :key="row.formKey" class="kb-collection" :class="{selected:selected?.formKey===row.formKey}"><div><el-tag size="small" :type="row.indexed?'success':'info'">{{ row.indexed?'已索引':'待同步' }}</el-tag><span class="kb-version">V{{ row.version }}</span><h4>{{ row.title }}</h4><p v-if="row.indexed">{{ row.answerCount }} 份答卷 · {{ row.documentCount }} 个片段</p><p v-else>首次同步后，可检索和分析这份问卷</p><small v-if="row.indexedAt">同步于 {{ date(row.indexedAt) }}</small><el-tag v-if="row.simulated" size="small" type="warning">包含模拟测试数据</el-tag></div><div class="kb-row-actions"><el-button size="small" :disabled="busy" @click="select(row)">查看资料</el-button><el-button size="small" type="primary" plain :disabled="busy" @click="sync(row)">{{ busyKey===row.formKey?'同步中…':'同步' }}</el-button></div></article>
      </section>
      <section class="kb-panel kb-preview"><header><h3>{{ selected ? selected.title : '检索体验' }}</h3><span>来源预览</span></header><el-empty v-if="!selected" description="选择一份问卷，查看它包含哪些资料" />
        <template v-else><div class="kb-search"><el-select v-model="version" aria-label="知识库发布版本" :disabled="busy" @change="detail=null"><el-option v-for="v in versions" :key="v.versionNo" :value="v.versionNo" :label="`V${v.versionNo}`" /></el-select><el-input v-model="query" aria-label="知识库检索问题" maxlength="1000" placeholder="例如：哪些反馈涉及时间安排？" :disabled="busy" @keyup.enter="search" /><el-button :disabled="busy||!query.trim()" @click="search">检索</el-button></div>
        <el-button class="kb-ask" type="primary" :disabled="busy" @click="ask">带着这个问题去问助手 →</el-button><p class="kb-note">本页查看检索证据，助手负责结合统计生成分析。第一版使用中文词片段检索和内容去重，尚未接入向量语义检索。</p>
        <template v-if="detail"><div class="kb-scope">V{{ detail.version }} · {{ detail.answerCount }} 份答卷 · {{ detail.documentCount }} 个片段<el-tag v-if="detail.simulated" type="warning" size="small">包含模拟数据</el-tag></div><el-alert v-if="detail.excludedEvidenceCount" :title="`本次有 ${detail.excludedEvidenceCount} 条开放回答因资料上限未入库，不能把检索结果视为全部答卷。`" type="warning" :closable="false" /><p class="kb-note">本轮最多索引 200 条开放回答，单条最多 2000 字，总计最多 60000 字；明显联系方式会被过滤，检索最多展示 12 条并去重。</p><article v-for="c in detail.citations" :key="c.id" class="kb-source"><div><el-tag size="small" :type="c.kind==='answer'?'success':'info'">{{ c.kind==='answer'?'回答原文':'题目背景' }}</el-tag><small>{{ c.id }}</small></div><h4>{{ c.question }}</h4><blockquote>{{ c.text }}</blockquote><small v-if="c.answerId">答卷 {{ c.answerId }} · 题目 {{ c.fieldId }}</small></article><el-empty v-if="!detail.citations.length" description="暂无可用资料" /></template>
        </template>
      </section>
    </div>
    <p class="kb-note">分析时，检索片段与后端统计会发送给系统配置的模型。资料中明显的邮箱、手机和证件号会被遮蔽；请避免在开放题中收集无关的个人信息。</p>
  </section>
</template>
<script setup>
import {ref,onMounted} from 'vue'
import {useRouter} from 'vue-router'
import {listKnowledge,syncKnowledge,searchKnowledge} from '@/api/project/knowledge'
import {assistantVersions} from '@/api/project/assistant'
const router=useRouter(),rows=ref([]),selected=ref(null),detail=ref(null),versions=ref([]),version=ref(null),query=ref('总结主要反馈，并说明有哪些证据支持'),error=ref(''),loading=ref(false),busy=ref(false),busyKey=ref('')
const date=v=>new Date(v).toLocaleString('zh-CN',{hour12:false})
const fail=e=>e?.msg||e?.message||'知识库操作失败，请重试'
async function load(){loading.value=true;error.value='';try{rows.value=(await listKnowledge()).data}catch(e){error.value=fail(e)}finally{loading.value=false}}
async function select(row){if(busy.value)return;busy.value=true;error.value='';selected.value=row;detail.value=null;version.value=row.version;try{versions.value=(await assistantVersions(row.formKey)).data}catch(e){error.value=fail(e)}finally{busy.value=false}}
async function sync(row){if(busy.value)return;await select(row);busy.value=true;busyKey.value=row.formKey;error.value='';try{detail.value=(await syncKnowledge({formKey:row.formKey,version:version.value})).data;await load()}catch(e){error.value=fail(e)}finally{busy.value=false;busyKey.value=''}}
async function search(){if(busy.value||!selected.value||!query.value.trim())return;busy.value=true;error.value='';detail.value=null;try{detail.value=(await searchKnowledge({formKey:selected.value.formKey,version:version.value,question:query.value})).data;await load()}catch(e){error.value=fail(e)}finally{busy.value=false}}
function ask(){router.push({path:'/home/assistant',query:{formKey:selected.value.formKey,version:version.value,title:selected.value.title,question:query.value||'总结这份问卷的答卷'}})}
onMounted(load)
</script>
<style scoped>
.knowledge-page :deep(.el-input__inner){background:var(--zy-surface-subtle)!important;color:var(--zy-text)!important;box-shadow:none!important}.knowledge-page :deep(.el-input__wrapper){background:var(--zy-surface-subtle)!important}.knowledge-page :deep(.el-tag){background:rgba(32,185,198,.12)!important;color:var(--zy-accent-cyan,#0891b2)!important;border-color:rgba(32,185,198,.3)!important}.knowledge-page :deep(.el-tag--warning){background:rgba(217,119,6,.14)!important;color:var(--zy-warning,#d97706)!important;border-color:rgba(217,119,6,.3)!important}
.knowledge-page{padding:28px;box-sizing:border-box;height:100%;overflow:auto;color:var(--zy-text,#233247);background:var(--zy-page,#f5f7fa)}.kb-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;margin-bottom:24px}.kb-heading h2{font-size:25px;margin:9px 0}.kb-heading p,.kb-note{font-size:12px;line-height:1.9;color:var(--zy-text-secondary,#667085)}.kb-eyebrow{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#26b7c7}.kb-metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px;margin-bottom:22px}.kb-metrics article,.kb-panel{border:1px solid var(--zy-border,#dfe5ef);border-radius:16px;background:var(--zy-surface,#fff)}.kb-metrics article{padding:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}.kb-metrics strong{font-size:32px;color:#20b9c6}.kb-metrics span{font-size:13px}.kb-metrics small,.kb-source small,.kb-collection small{font-size:11px;color:var(--zy-text-secondary,#667085);overflow-wrap:anywhere}.kb-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(300px,.9fr) minmax(400px,1.25fr);gap:20px;align-items:start}.kb-panel{padding:20px;min-width:0}.kb-panel header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;align-items:center}.kb-panel header h3{font-size:16px;margin:0}.kb-panel header span{font-size:11px;color:var(--zy-text-secondary,#667085)}.kb-collection{padding:18px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--zy-border,#e4e7ec);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px}.kb-collection.selected{border-left:3px solid #20b9c6;padding-left:10px}.kb-collection h4{font-size:14px;margin:10px 0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.kb-collection p{font-size:12px;color:var(--zy-text-secondary,#667085)}.kb-version{font-size:11px;margin-left:10px}.kb-row-actions{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px;justify-content:center;flex:none}.kb-row-actions .el-button{margin:0}.kb-search{display:flex;gap:8px;margin:20px 0 12px;flex-wrap:wrap}.kb-search .el-select{width:100px}.kb-search .el-input{flex:1;min-width:150px}.kb-ask{margin-bottom:8px}.kb-scope{font-size:12px;display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:20px 0}.kb-source{border-top:1px solid var(--zy-border,#e4e7ec);padding:16px 0}.kb-source>div{display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:center}.kb-source h4{font-size:13px;line-height:1.8}.kb-source blockquote{font-size:13px;line-height:1.9;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;margin:10px 0;padding:10px 12px;border-left:3px solid #20b9c6;background:rgba(32,185,198,.06)}
@media(max-width:1000px){.kb-layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}}@media(max-width:600px){.knowledge-page{padding:14px}.kb-heading{align-items:flex-start}.kb-heading h2{font-size:20px}.kb-metrics{gap:8px}.kb-metrics article{padding:12px}.kb-metrics strong{font-size:25px}.kb-metrics small{font-size:10px}.kb-panel{padding:14px}.kb-ask{max-width:100%;white-space:normal;height:auto;min-height:34px}}
</style>
